{"result":"{
  "id": "18141",
  "key": "SFCC-96",
  "summary": "Expanded Navigation - PWA Kit and Contentful",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18141",
  "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see a mega menu appear when I hover over or click a top-level navigation category on desktop, so that I can quickly browse subcategories and editorial content without leaving the current page.\nAs a Site Merchandiser, I want to manage the mega menu content in Contentful, so that subcategory links, editorial links, and campaign imagery can be updated per storefront without a code deployment.\n\\_\nThis story covers both the Contentful content model and the PWA Kit component build for the expanded desktop navigation (mega menu). The component has been partially built — this story formalises the Contentful integration, editorial content slots, and completes the remaining behaviour.\nWhat the mega menu displays:\nOn hover or click of a top-level nav item, a full-width panel opens below the header containing two areas:\n- \\*\\*Left column\\* — subcategory links (e.g. DRESSES, BAGS, TAILORING) followed by editorial links (e.g. FALL 2026, VIEW ALL)\n- \\*\\*Right area\\* — a large campaign image\nA CLOSE control is available top-right to dismiss the panel.\nAll mega menu content — subcategory links, editorial links, campaign imagery, and their ordering — is managed in Contentful. This allows the nav structure to include editorial destinations (e.g. campaign or collection pages) alongside standard category links, without requiring a code change. Content can vary per storefront.\n\\*UI Kit:\\* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann\\*Design\\*System\\*2026?node-id=2083-53877&p=f&t=GBRCVRrX3RCrbURg-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann\\*Design\\*System\\*2026)\n\\*Designs:\\* [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann\\*Designs?node-id=3051-37191&t=7MDyoGWpJfsFAZI3-0](https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann\\*Designs)\n\\*Product Category Taxonomy:\\* [Product Category Taxonomy](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/380043284/ProductCategoryTaxonomy)\nNew / Collections: Seasonal\n----\n\\*\\*Reference Images (Figma is leading):\\*\\*\n\\*Desktop:\\*\n![\"image-20260824-080207.png\"](image-20260824-080207.png)",
  "status": {
    "name": "Ready For Review",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
